                "text": "Good points! How do you approach issues you can't easily trace? Having retries on a function level and maybe even on a worker level increases the resilience of an app/service quite well but that does not fully work if you run out of memory for example. It's often the case that you don't even see an error log because the service crashed. That's something I found very tricky in the past."
